{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A Cardinal, an expert in the occult, was sent with his acolytes to a remote island.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The mission was to unravel the secrets of an ancient civilization...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your task is to find them...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But what you will discover will test your faith... and your humanity.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Descripci\u00f3n</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthouse Of The Souls is a third-person action Roguelite with RPG mechanics and realistic graphics. Face the challenges of a dark world alone or with friends, where survival will depend on your skill and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purge Zones:</strong> Clean areas infested with corruption by completing different missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Immerse yourself in a realistic, dark and immersive environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Enemies:</strong> Eliminate different enemies, who will test your skill in intense combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Equipment:</strong> Use the souls you collect to buy and upgrade your equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve your character:</strong> Gain experience and upgrade  skills that fit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel through portals:</strong> Face powerful bosses that represent the ultimate corruption, accessing their domains through portals.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare to fight so that the souls of humanity can find their rest.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Choose your Hero</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://share